<title>PAKISTAN: ICI Pakistan TFC oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>ICI Pakistan TFC oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Term Finance Certificates (TFCs) issued by ICI Pakistan Ltd have been oversubscribed, a company executive said on Sunday.</p>
<p>He said that ICI Pakistan had received subscription of 374 million rupees ($10.11 million) against an offer for the 5,000-rupee certificates worth 250 million rupees.</p>
<p>&quot;ICI Pakistan is pleased to announce that the public issue of its TFC has been oversubscribed,&quot; the executive said. The issue will help finance ICI Pakistan's $450 million pure terephthalic acid (PTA) plant being built near Karachi.</p>
<p>($1 = 37.06 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
